# # /stjotando/
#
# Permanent identifiers for @stjotando, an OWL/RDF ontology of the Brazilian
# Superior Court of Justice (Superior Tribunal de Justica, STJ): its judging
# bodies, jurisdiction and the legal provisions that govern it (Constitution,
# federal statutes, Internal Rules), with versioned provisions identified by
# LexML URNs. It is used to trace editorial claims back to their legal sources.
#
# https://w3id.org/stjotando/<path> redirects (303) to
# https://calixto-1.tail13f373.ts.net:8443/ontologia/<path>
# Content negotiation (HTML documentation or Turtle) is done by the target.
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Joao Calixto
# GitHub username: joaocalixto1004

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://calixto-1.tail13f373.ts.net:8443/ontologia/$1 [R=303,L]
